---
title: Post page
layout: home
description: One post, whole — a hero you can swap, a breadcrumb, an author you hover rather than read, the body on the real canvas, a column beside it and everything that belongs after the last paragraph. The controls are the settings a theme would offer; everything below them is one page, not a gallery.
eyebrow: Collections · Post
source: src/components/post-hero.css · content.css · widget.css · post-footer.css · comments.css
